<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for holidays.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's stock market was closed on Tuesday for the Christmas holidays.</p>
<p>The next trading day is Thursday, December 26.</p>
<p>On Monday, the all share index closed 1.2 points down at 595.8 on turnover of 16.1 million rupees.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
